Vaidehi shaken shamed pierced by word-darts weeps before crowd --- Sita wipes face and asks why low harsh unworthy words like to a common woman --- Sita swears by conduct she is not as thought with heart in Rama and helpless limbs fate at fault --- Sita says if unknown after growing together she is destroyed forever --- Sita asks why she was not abandoned when Hanuman found her sparing vain labour and friends strain --- Sita reproaches anger-driven lightness honouring womanhood and ignoring Janaka earth birth devotion virtue and childhood hand --- Weeping Sita bids mournful Lakshmana make a pyre as remedy unable to live under false slander --- Lakshmana discerns Rama mind from gestures and builds a pyre --- Sita circumambulates downcast Rama bows to gods and brahmins and vows heart never leaving Raghava let Fire protect --- Sita circumambulates and enters blazing fire with detached soul --- Old young crowd beholds and rakshasas monkeys raise a vast wondrous alas cry